WEBVTT

00:00:05.540 --> 00:00:06.880
<b>It's been too long</b>

00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:10.090
<b>since we've talked like this.</b>

00:00:10.710 --> 00:00:11.550
<b>It has.</b>

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:16.300
<b>Have you been well?</b>

00:00:17.600 --> 00:00:19.930
<b>Yes. I have.</b>

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:22.560
<b>Right.</b>

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.400
<b>That's good to know.</b>

00:00:26.560 --> 00:00:30.440
<b>Well, I've got an early start tomorrow,
so I better go get some shuteye.</b>

00:00:31.030 --> 00:00:31.940
<b>Already?</b>

00:00:32.530 --> 00:00:34.900
<b>As long as you're okay,
that's all I need to know.</b>

00:00:34.990 --> 00:00:37.120
<b>What? Oh, okay…</b>

00:00:37.200 --> 00:00:39.950
<b>But it must have been
hard work finding me here.</b>

00:00:40.040 --> 00:00:42.750
<b>Not for me. I didn't do anything.</b>

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:46.620
<b>But it sounds like Amidamaru
had his work cut out for him!</b>

00:00:46.710 --> 00:00:50.880
<b>No sooner had our match ended did I fly
to every last corner of this island.</b>

00:00:51.460 --> 00:00:53.470
<b>But such a task is child's play for me.</b>

00:00:53.550 --> 00:00:54.920
<b>Hey, don't try so hard.</b>

00:00:55.010 --> 00:00:56.380
<b>I'm saying it's child's play!</b>

00:00:56.470 --> 00:00:58.140
<b>Okay, I get the picture!</b>

00:00:58.220 --> 00:00:59.640
<b>Not so loud!</b>

00:00:59.720 --> 00:01:01.260
<b>You'll wake everyone up!</b>

00:01:01.930 --> 00:01:02.770
<b>"Everyone"?</b>

00:01:03.350 --> 00:01:06.560
<b>Everyone from the X-Laws
who's on this ship!</b>

00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:09.110
<b>They say it's dangerous to go alone,</b>

00:01:09.190 --> 00:01:12.150
<b>so there's a rule against
leaving the ship by yourself.</b>

00:01:12.230 --> 00:01:13.820
<b>Is there?</b>

00:01:13.900 --> 00:01:15.610
<b>Sorry about this then.</b>

00:01:15.700 --> 00:01:18.410
<b>But you did come
all this way just to see me,</b>

00:01:18.490 --> 00:01:19.820
<b>so I could hardly ignore you.</b>

00:01:20.490 --> 00:01:23.910
<b>Besides, there's something
I want to talk to you about too.</b>

00:01:24.750 --> 00:01:25.830
<b>There is?</b>

