00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.540
<b>Ep.24</b>

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.540
<b>Ep.24</b>

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.540
<b>Trust No One</b>

00:02:57.530 --> 00:03:02.540
<b>Trust No One</b>

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:07.520
<b>I've wanted to apologize to you.</b>

00:03:08.890 --> 00:03:11.770
<b>You did so much for me back in America,</b>

00:03:11.850 --> 00:03:15.900
<b>so doing what I did without so much
as letting you know feels like a betrayal.</b>

00:03:16.900 --> 00:03:20.700
<b>When I was with you guys,
I felt so scared of my own weakness.</b>

00:03:20.780 --> 00:03:23.160
<b>I was afraid of wavering.</b>

00:03:23.740 --> 00:03:27.290
<b>There's no need to apologize for that,
right, Amidamaru?</b>

00:03:27.870 --> 00:03:31.160
<b>If it's your decision, Master Lyserg,
that's all that matters.</b>

00:03:31.710 --> 00:03:34.170
<b>Master Yoh will not reproach you
over every petty detail.</b>

00:03:35.840 --> 00:03:39.510
<b>Right. That's the kind of guy you are.</b>

00:03:40.170 --> 00:03:42.880
<b>Honestly, what am I going on about?</b>

00:03:48.680 --> 00:03:51.890
<b>Anna will give me hell,
so I better get going.</b>

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:55.190
<b>Come hang out with us next time.</b>

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:57.190
<b>Everyone, all together.</b>

00:03:57.860 --> 00:03:58.940
<b>Okay.</b>

00:03:59.530 --> 00:04:02.070
<b>And don't push yourself too hard, Lyserg.</b>

00:04:04.360 --> 00:04:05.490
<b><i><i>Yoh…</i></i></b>

00:04:06.120 --> 00:04:08.490
<b><i><i>Thank you so much for coming here today.</i></i></b>

00:04:10.080 --> 00:04:12.870
<b>Stop right there.
Don't move a muscle, boy.</b>

00:04:14.960 --> 00:04:15.960
<b>Marco!</b>

00:04:17.090 --> 00:04:18.500
<b>Lyserg Diethel…</b>

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:22.420
<b>Good boys go to bed
at eight o'clock, do they not?</b>

00:04:23.470 --> 00:04:24.630
<b>Insolent brat!</b>

00:04:26.390 --> 00:04:27.300
<b>Lyserg!</b>

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.680
<b>I told you not to move.</b>

00:04:31.520 --> 00:04:32.680
<b>Not to mention,</b>

00:04:32.770 --> 00:04:34.730
<b>you should worry about your own welfare.</b>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.030
<b>Master Yoh!</b>

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:43.030
<b>Right.</b>

00:04:43.110 --> 00:04:45.660
<b>The whole X-Laws crew is here, huh?</b>

00:04:46.610 --> 00:04:48.830
<b>We don't have any business with you.</b>

00:04:48.910 --> 00:04:50.450
<b>Interrogate him.</b>

00:04:51.040 --> 00:04:53.750
<b>He could be one of Hao's followers,</b>

00:04:53.830 --> 00:04:57.330
<b>here to deceive our comrade
into joining their evil cause.</b>

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.170
<b>What?</b>

00:04:57.420 --> 00:04:59.170
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:04:59.750 --> 00:05:02.210
<b>There'll be no need for that, Marco.</b>

00:05:04.010 --> 00:05:05.130
<b>In that last match,</b>

00:05:05.720 --> 00:05:09.050
<b>his Furyoku was peaceful and perfectly clear.</b>

00:05:10.680 --> 00:05:13.560
<b>Asakura Yoh is not evil.</b>

00:05:14.810 --> 00:05:16.020
<b>The Iron Maiden!</b>

00:05:16.600 --> 00:05:19.690
<b>With all due respect, Ms. Maiden,
this boy has a history</b>

00:05:20.440 --> 00:05:22.190
<b><i>of obstructing our justice.</i></b>

00:05:22.280 --> 00:05:25.150
<b><i>He once protected one of Hao's followers!</i></b>

00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:27.910
<b>Lower your gun, Marco.</b>

00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:33.040
<b>What way is that to treat our friend?</b>

00:05:34.750 --> 00:05:37.370
<b>Any friend of a friend is our friend.</b>

00:05:37.960 --> 00:05:39.580
<b>They came all this way</b>

00:05:39.670 --> 00:05:43.090
<b>just for the sake
of our comrade, Lyserg Diethel.</b>

00:05:43.670 --> 00:05:45.720
<b>A kindhearted boy like him</b>

00:05:45.800 --> 00:05:48.840
<b>ought to be welcomed with open arms.</b>

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.930
<b>Yes. We should greet him
as one of us, X-Laws!</b>

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.270
<b>What did she say?</b>

00:05:57.390 --> 00:05:59.270
<b>What did she say?</b>

00:05:59.850 --> 00:06:01.400
<b>You must be joking, Ms. Maiden!</b>

00:06:01.980 --> 00:06:04.190
<b>Showing your face like this
is the most immodest!</b>

00:06:04.280 --> 00:06:07.650
<b>Oh, it's no joke, Marco!</b>

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:11.990
<b>His Furyoku is more than strong enough
for him to join our ranks.</b>

00:06:12.660 --> 00:06:13.580
<b>Look.</b>

00:06:14.160 --> 00:06:15.790
<b>Even after all of this,</b>

00:06:15.870 --> 00:06:19.330
<b>he remains completely and utterly unfazed.</b>

00:06:20.290 --> 00:06:21.710
<b>So laid-back!</b>

00:06:21.790 --> 00:06:23.800
<b>How about it, Asakura Yoh?</b>

00:06:24.380 --> 00:06:26.590
<b>Will you join us in defeating Hao</b>

00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:29.300
<b>and building a wonderful paradise?</b>

00:06:35.220 --> 00:06:38.430
<b>Not happening.
Anna would never allow it, for one.</b>

00:06:39.020 --> 00:06:41.690
<b>And I don't like how you do things.</b>

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:44.480
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:06:49.320 --> 00:06:50.360
<b>Is that…</b>

00:06:51.070 --> 00:06:52.280
<b>so?</b>

00:06:55.240 --> 00:06:57.660
<b>I am very sad.</b>

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:00.460
<b>Damn you!</b>

00:07:03.500 --> 00:07:06.050
<b>This is exactly why I don't like you.</b>

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:09.590
<b>Stop it!</b>

00:07:11.430 --> 00:07:15.050
<b>He is more than a match for you now.</b>

00:07:16.060 --> 00:07:17.600
<b>It is truly regrettable</b>

00:07:18.180 --> 00:07:19.770
<b>that one day,</b>

00:07:19.850 --> 00:07:22.810
<b>we will have
to judge your life as our foe.</b>

00:07:26.230 --> 00:07:30.150
<b>Honestly… Why do you guys
have to take everything so seriously?</b>

00:07:31.860 --> 00:07:33.950
<b>Good night, Iron Maiden.</b>

00:07:34.030 --> 00:07:36.160
<b>See you back at the Shaman Fight tomorrow.</b>

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.480
<b>MATCH FOUR</b>

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:43.480
HANA-GUMI

00:07:47.040 --> 00:07:48.130
<b>I'm bored.</b>

00:07:48.920 --> 00:07:50.670
<b>That's just how it is, Mari.</b>

00:07:51.550 --> 00:07:54.090
<b>Damn… You just couldn't wait, could you?</b>

00:07:54.180 --> 00:07:56.720
<b>We didn't get
to do anything, thanks to you.</b>

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.180
<b>But they were giving me the creeps.</b>

00:08:00.270 --> 00:08:02.350
<b>Yeah! Me too!</b>

00:08:02.940 --> 00:08:07.110
<b>Oh, well. This ending so quickly
means our treat will come even sooner.</b>

00:08:07.190 --> 00:08:09.440
<b>What treat? How exciting!</b>

00:08:10.070 --> 00:08:12.950
<b>Didn't you listen to Opacho's
prophecy this morning?</b>

00:08:13.030 --> 00:08:15.240
<b>About who's in the next match?</b>

00:08:17.530 --> 00:08:19.950
<b>It's a one-sided victory for Hana-gumi!</b>

00:08:20.540 --> 00:08:21.910
<b>What a stunning display!</b>

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:26.210
<b>As soon as the match began,
they ended it at Mach speed!</b>

00:08:26.290 --> 00:08:27.790
<b>It's over already?</b>

00:08:27.880 --> 00:08:29.960
<b>What a bunch of pushovers.</b>

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:31.710
<b>They can't be that weak!</b>

00:08:31.800 --> 00:08:33.840
<b>They did make it this far!</b>

00:08:33.930 --> 00:08:35.890
<b>Hana-gumi must be pretty damn tough.</b>

00:08:37.260 --> 00:08:40.640
<b>At this stage,
it will be impossible to evaluate</b>

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.770
<b>just how strong he actually is.</b>

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:45.560
<b>You're right.</b>

00:08:47.020 --> 00:08:50.070
<b>I wonder how they're going to fight.</b>

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:55.140
Hoshi-gumi

00:08:50.730 --> 00:08:52.860
<b>Hoshi-gumi versus X-III!</b>

00:08:52.940 --> 00:08:55.070
<b>The fated showdown is finally happening!</b>

00:08:55.950 --> 00:08:59.700
<b>I'm sure everyone in this stadium
is familiar with both teams!</b>

00:09:00.330 --> 00:09:04.960
<b>There will be no one who doesn't know
Hoshi-gumi's leader, Hao, at least.</b>

00:09:05.040 --> 00:09:06.750
<b>Their opponents, X-III,</b>

00:09:06.830 --> 00:09:08.630
<b>are members of the X-Laws,</b>

00:09:08.710 --> 00:09:12.800
<b>an organization whose sole purpose is,
believe it or not, to defeat Hao!</b>

00:09:13.380 --> 00:09:14.970
<b><i>I can't say any more,</i></b>

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:18.390
<b><i>as the Patch Tribe takes
a strictly neutral position,</i></b>

00:09:18.470 --> 00:09:20.300
<b><i>but let's just say I'm kind of pumped!</i></b>

00:09:20.390 --> 00:09:21.970
<b>That idiot announcer.</b>

00:09:22.060 --> 00:09:24.480
<b>He always talks too much!</b>

00:09:25.060 --> 00:09:27.190
<b><i>Who will emerge victoriously?</i></b>

00:09:27.270 --> 00:09:28.440
<b>What a dumb question.</b>

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:30.980
<b>The answer's obvious already.</b>

00:09:32.530 --> 00:09:36.950
<b>Will X-III's long-held dream
finally come true?</b>

00:09:37.990 --> 00:09:40.240
<b>Dreams don't come true.</b>

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.660
<b>They're made true!</b>

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.410
<b>I am Venstar, the captain of X-III.</b>

00:09:46.080 --> 00:09:51.380
<b>We have orders from our leader,
Ms. Maiden, to deliver your sentence.</b>

00:09:53.130 --> 00:09:54.090
<b>Death!</b>

00:09:54.170 --> 00:09:55.920
<b>Now those are fighting words!</b>

00:09:56.010 --> 00:09:59.050
<b>X-III are raring to go!</b>

00:10:00.470 --> 00:10:01.800
<b>What is this?</b>

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:06.640
<b>Hana-gumi just wrapped
their match up in no time at all.</b>

00:10:07.230 --> 00:10:09.440
<b>I've decided to fight by myself</b>

00:10:09.520 --> 00:10:11.770
<b>in order to entertain the crowd more.</b>

00:10:12.940 --> 00:10:14.570
<b>It's still not enough, though.</b>

00:10:15.400 --> 00:10:19.360
<b>You might as well come at me
with all your friends now.</b>

00:10:20.070 --> 00:10:22.830
<b>And of course,
that includes the weird girl too.</b>

00:10:22.910 --> 00:10:25.700
<b>No way! Even bigger fighting words!</b>

00:10:25.790 --> 00:10:29.170
<b>He just called
Jeanne the Iron Maiden a "weird girl!"</b>

00:10:29.250 --> 00:10:30.830
<b>I mean, it is true, though.</b>

00:10:31.420 --> 00:10:32.380
<b>Bastard!</b>

00:10:34.170 --> 00:10:36.510
<b>The tension here is at a breaking point!</b>

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.920
<b>Here we go!</b>

00:10:38.010 --> 00:10:39.720
<b>Match five of the Primary Tournament!</b>

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.600
<b>Hoshi-gumi versus X-III!</b>

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:49.640
<b>Take this!</b>

00:10:48.680 --> 00:10:49.640
<b>Take this!</b>

00:10:52.020 --> 00:10:54.070
<b>My Spirit Ally, the holy angel,</b>

00:10:54.150 --> 00:10:55.230
<b>Metatron!</b>

00:10:57.610 --> 00:10:58.490
<b>Gabriel!</b>

00:11:01.030 --> 00:11:01.990
<b>Ramiel!</b>

00:11:04.200 --> 00:11:06.330
<b>9700 Furyoku.</b>

00:11:07.160 --> 00:11:08.830
<b>8300.</b>

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.420
<b>10,500.</b>

00:11:12.750 --> 00:11:13.920
<b>Seriously?</b>

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.170
<b>So small.</b>

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.510
<b>Fire!</b>

00:11:16.000 --> 00:11:17.510
<b>Fire!</b>

00:11:29.810 --> 00:11:31.520
<b>She was first.</b>

00:11:33.650 --> 00:11:35.310
<b>And the slim one is next!</b>

00:11:35.820 --> 00:11:38.110
<b>I'm going to destroy you.</b>

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:55.960
<b>Meene of X-III is dead.</b>

00:11:56.040 --> 00:11:57.630
<b>That was overwhelming!</b>

00:11:57.710 --> 00:12:01.300
<b>Hoshi-gumi's Hao
has just put on a dominant show of power!</b>

00:12:02.300 --> 00:12:03.590
<b>He's twisted!</b>

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.850
<b>This isn't a match!
It's just senseless killing!</b>

00:12:08.430 --> 00:12:09.520
<b>Where are you going?</b>

00:12:09.600 --> 00:12:11.980
<b>I'm going to stop this damn match!</b>

00:12:14.100 --> 00:12:15.020
<b>Don't do it.</b>

00:12:16.190 --> 00:12:18.480
<b>They're still fighting.</b>

00:12:19.530 --> 00:12:20.780
<b>Don't get in their way.</b>

00:12:22.030 --> 00:12:23.110
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:12:24.200 --> 00:12:26.320
<b>It's not over. Not yet!</b>

00:12:29.240 --> 00:12:31.370
<b>By the time we were aware of his attack,</b>

00:12:31.450 --> 00:12:33.870
<b>Gabriel had already been destroyed.</b>

00:12:34.500 --> 00:12:37.500
<b>Which means that Spirit of Fire</b>

00:12:37.590 --> 00:12:40.340
<b>is an extremely fast Over Soul?</b>

00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:43.090
<b>We cannot be certain of that.</b>

00:12:43.670 --> 00:12:47.300
<b>First, we need to locate
his intermediary, you mean?</b>

00:12:47.390 --> 00:12:49.390
<b>What's with those guys?</b>

00:12:49.470 --> 00:12:52.220
<b>Their teammate just died
and they're just talking calmly!</b>

00:12:52.310 --> 00:12:53.430
<b>Very well.</b>

00:12:54.310 --> 00:12:58.110
<b>Time for me to step up to the plate.</b>

00:12:59.320 --> 00:13:00.860
<b>This is a surprise.</b>

00:13:01.480 --> 00:13:04.280
<b>You seem awfully composed.</b>

00:13:04.360 --> 00:13:07.620
<b>I was sure you'd go mad with rage.</b>

00:13:07.700 --> 00:13:11.200
<b>Is there some kind of reason behind this?</b>

00:13:11.700 --> 00:13:14.250
<b>That's none of your concern, Hao.</b>

00:13:14.830 --> 00:13:19.210
<b>I'm only here
to defeat you and nothing else.</b>

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:22.250
<b>So I can achieve vengeance
for what you did to me</b>

00:13:22.340 --> 00:13:24.220
<b>ten years ago!</b>

00:13:25.840 --> 00:13:26.800
<b>I see.</b>

00:13:31.560 --> 00:13:35.060
<b>I'll just get rid of this pesky corpse
so we can get straight down to it!</b>

00:13:35.560 --> 00:13:37.520
<b>You guys sure are funny.</b>

00:13:38.270 --> 00:13:41.980
<b>Knowing you can't win,
but coming here just to die anyway!</b>

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:44.570
<b>There are some things you don't know
until you try them.</b>

00:13:45.570 --> 00:13:47.030
<b>My Ramiel</b>

00:13:47.110 --> 00:13:50.910
<b>is an angel tasked with administering
the fate of souls awaiting resurrection!</b>

00:13:50.990 --> 00:13:52.700
<b>He will plunge your soul</b>

00:13:52.790 --> 00:13:56.040
<b>straight into eternal damnation!</b>

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:01.420
<b>Hell?</b>

00:14:01.500 --> 00:14:02.880
<b>I got bored of that long ago.</b>

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.720
<b>This is awful!</b>

00:14:13.720 --> 00:14:15.720
<b>Wait a minute!</b>

00:14:15.810 --> 00:14:17.020
<b>When did he…</b>

00:14:17.100 --> 00:14:19.310
<b>That was too fast even for me to see.</b>

00:14:20.060 --> 00:14:21.690
<b>My liege! This is…</b>

00:14:21.770 --> 00:14:24.690
<b>Yeah. The same thing as before.</b>

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:30.360
<b>But their deaths might prove
my prediction to be correct.</b>

00:14:33.330 --> 00:14:36.000
<b>So they really were planning
on dying from the start.</b>

00:14:37.910 --> 00:14:39.290
<b>The way things are,</b>

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:42.920
<b>not even all of them together
could defeat Hao, and they knew it.</b>

00:14:43.000 --> 00:14:47.420
<b>So instead of going after him elsewhere,
they all entered the Shaman Fight.</b>

00:14:48.050 --> 00:14:48.880
<b>No…</b>

00:14:48.970 --> 00:14:51.140
<b>I met them yesterday.</b>

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:52.970
<b>That's how I know.</b>

00:14:54.010 --> 00:14:56.520
<b>They intend to defeat Hao,</b>

00:14:56.600 --> 00:14:58.640
<b>no matter what they have to sacrifice.</b>

00:15:03.610 --> 00:15:06.610
<b>How many times
do I have to tell you, Lyserg Diethel?</b>

00:15:07.400 --> 00:15:08.900
<b>If we are to defeat Hao,</b>

00:15:08.990 --> 00:15:12.660
<b>the first thing we need to do
is to discover his secrets!</b>

00:15:14.030 --> 00:15:16.200
<b>As long as he's after the Great Spirit,</b>

00:15:16.290 --> 00:15:19.910
<b>he also must compete
in the Shaman Fight and win.</b>

00:15:20.920 --> 00:15:22.670
<b>Fighting him up close and in person</b>

00:15:22.750 --> 00:15:26.420
<b>is the best chance we have
to provide Ms. Maiden with data!</b>

00:15:27.630 --> 00:15:28.800
<b>But…</b>

00:15:28.880 --> 00:15:31.340
<b>I just feel so sorry for everyone.</b>

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.260
<b>That's enough, don't you think, Marco?</b>

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.260
<b>Damn you!</b>

00:15:35.890 --> 00:15:37.060
<b>Guys!</b>

00:15:37.140 --> 00:15:39.350
<b>Give him a break for today.</b>

00:15:39.430 --> 00:15:43.900
<b>We've just had the X-Conference,
yet you two sure have a lot of energy.</b>

00:15:44.730 --> 00:15:47.320
<b>This is no time for jokes, Kevin.</b>

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.360
<b>You've seen the tournament bracket.</b>

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:52.030
<b>You three will be
the first to take Hao on.</b>

00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:55.160
<b>And Lyserg being so soft…</b>

00:15:55.240 --> 00:15:56.660
<b>You're so straitlaced.</b>

00:15:56.740 --> 00:16:00.410
<b>I understand how you feel,
and I'm grateful.</b>

00:16:00.500 --> 00:16:04.040
<b>But you need to consider how he feels too.</b>

00:16:04.120 --> 00:16:06.250
<b>Softness and kindness are different.</b>

00:16:06.340 --> 00:16:09.090
<b>And Lyserg is a truly kind young man!</b>

00:16:11.590 --> 00:16:14.590
<b>But that's just fine, Lyserg Diethel.</b>

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.220
<b>Your kindness</b>

00:16:17.300 --> 00:16:20.350
<b>is what our justice
needs more than anything.</b>

00:16:23.100 --> 00:16:26.440
<b>We will fight Hao and we will surely die.</b>

00:16:27.230 --> 00:16:29.820
<b>That's what we want.</b>

00:16:29.900 --> 00:16:32.490
<b>You must not let yourself be sad about it.</b>

00:16:32.570 --> 00:16:34.030
<b>We want you</b>

00:16:34.110 --> 00:16:36.870
<b>to watch our battle
with those kind eyes of yours.</b>

00:16:37.490 --> 00:16:41.080
<b>Nothing could make me happier</b>

00:16:41.160 --> 00:16:43.870
<b>than building
a wonderful future and paradise.</b>

00:16:45.710 --> 00:16:46.920
<b>Guys…</b>

00:16:49.290 --> 00:16:50.590
<b>Meene…</b>

00:16:50.670 --> 00:16:51.590
<b>Kevin…</b>

00:16:51.670 --> 00:16:54.590
<b>Where are you looking, Lyserg Diethel?</b>

00:16:56.430 --> 00:16:58.350
<b>The fight isn't over yet.</b>

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.810
<b>You must look up</b>

00:17:00.890 --> 00:17:03.390
<b>and see what happens with your own eyes.</b>

00:17:04.230 --> 00:17:05.310
<b>Until</b>

00:17:05.980 --> 00:17:06.900
<b>it really is over.</b>

00:17:09.900 --> 00:17:11.650
<b>Venstar!</b>

00:17:11.730 --> 00:17:14.950
<b>What a crushing victory!
It was over in a flash!</b>

00:17:15.030 --> 00:17:17.410
<b>He's just too strong! I wonder if anyone</b>

00:17:17.490 --> 00:17:20.530
<b>will dare to step
into the arena with Hao from now on!</b>

00:17:21.160 --> 00:17:23.870
<b>Oh, it's over already?</b>

00:17:23.950 --> 00:17:26.250
<b>I told them to all attack together.</b>

00:17:26.830 --> 00:17:29.290
<b>They really are a bunch of fools.</b>

00:17:29.880 --> 00:17:31.300
<b>X-Laws.</b>

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:36.010
<b>Sorry to spoil
your little research project,</b>

00:17:36.590 --> 00:17:39.800
<b>but no matter how many of you die,
you'll never be able to beat me.</b>

00:17:41.100 --> 00:17:43.810
<b>So Hao knew
they were doing that the whole time?</b>

00:17:43.890 --> 00:17:46.850
<b>And the X-Laws… It's all so terrible!</b>

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.810
<b>Yet you want me to keep quiet
and just watch, Yoh?</b>

00:17:51.070 --> 00:17:51.900
<b>Hey!</b>

00:17:54.650 --> 00:17:56.360
<b>Yoh…</b>

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.620
<b>So you saw through it, did you?</b>

00:18:01.370 --> 00:18:04.660
<b>But this execution isn't over yet.</b>

00:18:04.750 --> 00:18:08.420
<b>Our comrades' noble deaths
were not in vain!</b>

00:18:09.460 --> 00:18:10.960
<b>They allowed me</b>

00:18:11.040 --> 00:18:13.880
<b>to solve the mystery of your intermediary!</b>

00:18:14.710 --> 00:18:18.130
<b>Remarkable! Venstar is still alive!</b>

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.220
<b>The nerve!</b>

00:18:18.220 --> 00:18:21.220
<b>He's tough.</b>

00:18:21.850 --> 00:18:23.850
<b>He's still talking of executions even now?</b>

00:18:23.930 --> 00:18:26.600
<b>I can't believe he'd show
such disrespect to Lord Hao!</b>

00:18:26.680 --> 00:18:28.770
<b>It's not so bad, Luchist.</b>

00:18:29.980 --> 00:18:32.560
<b>This is a bit better
than total inadequacy.</b>

00:18:33.730 --> 00:18:35.820
<b>So Venstar, was it?</b>

00:18:35.900 --> 00:18:39.400
<b>What do you plan on doing with
the knowledge that air is my intermediary?</b>

00:18:41.160 --> 00:18:42.570
<b>Just as I thought.</b>

00:18:43.160 --> 00:18:44.870
<b>Fire needs oxygen to burn.</b>

00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:46.790
<b>As such,</b>

00:18:46.870 --> 00:18:51.580
<b>it's hard to imagine a better intermediary
for my Over Soul, Spirit of Fire.</b>

00:18:53.170 --> 00:18:54.500
<b>The bastard!</b>

00:18:54.590 --> 00:18:56.670
<b>He told us himself!</b>

00:18:57.510 --> 00:19:01.010
<b>Does this mean he's not afraid
at all for us to know that?</b>

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:04.050
<b>Or is it just a simple taunt?</b>

00:19:04.720 --> 00:19:06.180
<b>It's both.</b>

00:19:06.270 --> 00:19:09.560
<b>He's making a mockery
of Kevin and Meene's deaths!</b>

00:19:10.980 --> 00:19:14.310
<b>But Venstar is not
the kind of man to make idle conversation.</b>

00:19:14.400 --> 00:19:17.360
<b>If what Hao says is true,</b>

00:19:17.440 --> 00:19:21.110
<b>perhaps the death penalty
will still be possible.</b>

00:19:22.410 --> 00:19:23.950
<b>What's the matter?</b>

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:27.200
<b>If you're going to do something,
you'd better hurry, before you die.</b>

00:19:28.370 --> 00:19:29.410
<b>Silence, fiend!</b>

00:19:30.710 --> 00:19:32.040
<b>Officiant!</b>

00:19:32.120 --> 00:19:36.800
<b>Just how strong
is the barrier around this ring?</b>

00:19:37.380 --> 00:19:39.800
<b>What? Well, it's amazing!</b>

00:19:40.630 --> 00:19:44.850
<b><i>To prevent anyone interfering
in the sacred Shaman Fight,</i></b>

00:19:44.930 --> 00:19:49.180
<b>only I and the combatants entering
or leaving the arena can get through it!</b>

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.020
<b>Nothing else can pass in or out of it.</b>

00:19:52.100 --> 00:19:53.690
<b>It's invincible!</b>

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.150
<b>That's a relief to hear.</b>

00:19:59.900 --> 00:20:03.950
<b>So even if there was
a huge explosion inside the barrier,</b>

00:20:04.030 --> 00:20:06.740
<b>Ms. Maiden wouldn't be harmed!</b>

00:20:07.870 --> 00:20:09.410
<b>Hand Grenade X.</b>

00:20:10.290 --> 00:20:12.500
<b>It's a grenade modified by Venstar</b>

00:20:12.580 --> 00:20:15.540
<b>that he carries with him
should the need to use it ever arise.</b>

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:23.160
HAND GRENADE X

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:23.160
HAND GRENADE X

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:23.160
HAND GRENADE X

00:20:15.630 --> 00:20:23.160
HAND GRENADE X

00:20:17.040 --> 00:20:19.590
<b><i>To prevent it from blowing up
during the fight with Hao,</i></b>

00:20:19.670 --> 00:20:22.670
<b><i>he kept it behind a fireproof pad.</i></b>

00:20:24.260 --> 00:20:26.090
<b>Once it detonates,</b>

00:20:26.180 --> 00:20:29.260
<b>all of the oxygen
in the arena will be burned up!</b>

00:20:29.350 --> 00:20:30.680
<b>Lord Hao!</b>

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:35.730
<b>You've made a grave error, Hao.</b>

00:20:36.480 --> 00:20:38.730
<b>With the oxygen you use all gone,</b>

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.740
<b>there will be nothing left to protect you!</b>

00:20:43.240 --> 00:20:46.990
<b>This will mark
a great step forward for us!</b>

00:20:48.030 --> 00:20:50.870
<b>For Ms. Maiden! Forever!</b>

00:21:04.220 --> 00:21:05.300
<b>These guys are insane…</b>

00:21:06.090 --> 00:21:09.220
<b>There isn't even
any point in disqualifying them now!</b>

00:21:13.230 --> 00:21:15.100
<b>Venstar!</b>

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:19.360
<b>The X-Laws…</b>

00:21:20.070 --> 00:21:24.150
<b>They're real pieces of work,
but I can't criticize them after that.</b>

00:21:25.150 --> 00:21:27.610
<b>There's no way Hao survived that.</b>

00:21:27.700 --> 00:21:29.570
<b>He isn't dead yet.</b>

00:21:30.330 --> 00:21:31.620
<b>Yoh.</b>

00:21:33.700 --> 00:21:37.370
<b>How long am I supposed
to hold all this in?</b>

00:21:42.000 --> 00:21:43.170
<b>The truth is,</b>

00:21:43.760 --> 00:21:46.300
<b>I don't want to feel anger ever again.</b>

00:21:57.310 --> 00:22:01.060
<b>How many souls do you have
to toy with before you're satisfied…</b>

00:22:08.700 --> 00:22:10.030
<b>The Great Onmyoji,</b>

00:22:11.240 --> 00:22:12.830
<b>Asakura Hao?</b>

